<title>POLAND: Kruszwica turns to PLN 5.6 mln loss in Q2.</title>
<headline>Kruszwica turns to PLN 5.6 mln loss in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kruszwica preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating loss			 1.11   vs    6.45 profit</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			   5.95   vs    3.43 profit</p>
